WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.080
Seriously, we're leaving 
in five minutes.

00:00:02.080 --> 00:00:04.480
Okay, well that's exactly how 
long it takes me to get ready.

00:00:06.240 --> 00:00:09.120
To the first Friday night 
in our first London house.

00:00:09.120 --> 00:00:11.840
Wooo! Yes!

00:00:14.160 --> 00:00:16.560
This girl is my childhood 
sweetheart.

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:19.640
Birdy?

00:00:19.960 --> 00:00:20.920
Jesus Christ!

00:00:21.680 --> 00:00:22.160
Hi.

00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:24.920
Why do you have so many 
tiny towels?

00:00:25.040 --> 00:00:26.760
They're not tiny towels, 
they're face cloths.

00:00:29.120 --> 00:00:29.880
Who's it from?

00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:31.080
Who do you think?

00:00:32.040 --> 00:00:33.360
Birdy's got a boyfriend.

00:00:33.760 --> 00:00:35.360
Nothing will change, Maggie.

00:00:36.120 --> 00:00:37.680
That's only a thing people say 

00:00:37.680 --> 00:00:39.160
when everything's changing.

00:00:39.360 --> 00:00:42.920
You have always been my 
most important person.

00:00:43.320 --> 00:00:45.760
I don't know if we should be 
that to each other anymore.

00:00:49.120 --> 00:00:50.320
We're in this grubby,

00:00:50.320 --> 00:00:52.680
golden phase of life that is so short lived.

00:00:53.080 --> 00:00:55.160
Sorry I want to live before I die.

